IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SLORA-PAGE-ALLOC.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-ADAPTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RANK-VAL            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MAX-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ALLOCATED-PAGES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SLORA.
    IF NUM-ADAPTERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE ALLOCATED-PAGES = NUM-ADAPTERS * RANK-VAL * 4.
    IF MAX-PAGES > 0
        IF ALLOCATED-PAGES > MAX-PAGES
            MOVE MAX-PAGES TO ALLOCATED-PAGES.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ALLOCATED-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-ADAPTERS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
